==== positive tier=fast
CONSTANTS
    GroupCount = 3
    HotGroup = 1
    MaxReadySteps = 4
    BuggyRepeatHot = FALSE
    BuggyDeniedContinuation = FALSE
    BuggyEarlyContinuation = FALSE
    BuggyOverBudget = FALSE
    BuggyCloneBeforeAdmission = FALSE
    BuggyApplyBeforeOwnership = FALSE
    BuggyAliasMessages = FALSE
    BuggyUseLiveMembership = FALSE
SPECIFICATION Spec
INVARIANTS
    NoDuplicateFairVisit
    FairCoverageBeforeContinuation
    ContinuationRequiresProductiveAdvance
    ReadyStepBudgetBounded
    DeniedReadyDoesNotOwnMessages
    ConfigurationApplyRequiresOwnedMessages
    ReadyMessagesPreserved
    SnapshotMembershipMatchesAppliedIndex

==== heavy-liveness tier=heavy
